"help.item.study_markup_interop.title" = "Adjustable markup compatibility";
"help.item.study_markup_interop.detail" = "Study mode marks with adjustable color, thickness, and opacity are saved as appearance-backed Stamp annotations to preserve their look. Other PDF apps may not classify or re-edit them as semantic Highlight/Underline annotations.";
"help.item.runtime_annotation_trust.title" = "Annotations trusted in the current run";
"help.item.runtime_annotation_trust.detail" = "In Viewer and Study modes, an annotation can be moved or deleted only if it was created or explicitly re-edited during the current app run. After reopening a saved PDF or restoring a hibernated tab, switch to Editing mode and edit the annotation again to establish trust. This security tradeoff does not treat public markers inside a PDF as authority for destructive deletion.";
